### 8. Donations Collection
Tracks all donations to Masjids and Zakat to needy

```json
{
  "_id": ObjectId,
  "donorId": ObjectId, // Reference to Users
  "amount": 1000,
  "currency": "INR",
  "donationType": "masjid_donation", // "masjid_donation", "zakat"
  "masjidId": ObjectId, // Reference to Masjids (for donation collection UPI)
  "needyPersonId": ObjectId, // Reference to Needy Persons (null if masjid donation)
  "upiTransactionId": "UPI12345678901234567890",
  "recipientUpiId": "alnoor@upi",
  "paymentProofScreenshot": "url_to_screenshot",
  "transactionStatus": "completed", // "pending_verification", "completed", "rejected"
  "verifiedBy": ObjectId, // Reference to Users (Masjid Authority or Super Admin)
  "verifiedDate": ISODate("2026-05-12"),
  "receiptNumber": "RECEIPT-2026-00001",
  "receiptUrl": "url_to_receipt_pdf",
  "donationDate": ISODate("2026-05-12"),
  "createdAt": ISODate("2026-05-12")
}
```

**Indexes**:
- `donorId`
- `masjidId`
- `needyPersonId`
- `transactionStatus`
- `upiTransactionId` (unique within transaction date)
- `donationDate`
